    {
      "id": "b6f2c1e5-6963-4b4d-b816-2bd69b80255f",
      "name": "Sticky Note 17",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2352,
        1712
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 1180,
        "height": 280,
        "content": "## Lane B - Chase unsigned agreements\n\nRuns daily. Finds everything still out for signature, keeps only rows sent 3 or more days\nago that have not already been reminded, and fires a **first-party TurboSign reminder** -\nthe same reminder email the platform sends, not a separate nudge from a different address.\n\nThe `Reminded At` column is what stops it nagging every single day."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "02646cf6-e123-4c8a-b4a3-df49c7651312",
      "name": "Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        2416,
        2016
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
