    {
      "id": "1fc7d464-14f5-47b7-904d-d7e4769e4473",
      "name": "Sticky Note 24",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2352,
        2400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 1180,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Lane C - Settle\n\nTurboDocx calls this webhook the moment a document reaches a terminal state. It registers\nitself when you activate the workflow - there is nothing to configure in TurboDocx.\n\nOn **completed**: pull the executed PDF and its audit trail, file both in Drive, update\nAirtable, announce in Slack, and email accounting with the contract attached.\n\nOn **declined or voided**: update Airtable and tell Slack. Silence on the unhappy path is\nhow deals quietly die."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7ce00370-0622-422d-909b-3ad248c35e49",
      "name": "Agreement reached a final state",
      "type": "@turbodocx/n8n-nodes-turbodocx.turboDocxTrigger",
      "position": [
        2416,
        2880
      ],
      "webhookId": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "signature.document.completed",
          "signature.document.voided"
        ]
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d8aeddf4-a373-4239-8ecc-285be5f25335",
      "name": "Find the Airtable row by document ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "position": [
